{"max_tokens":8192,"messages":[{"content":"Follow the public QA protocol in the user message. It contains the current task, evidence, state, tool/interface rules and strict response schemas. Make the choices required by that interface and return exactly one allowed JSON Action, Update, or Final. Use only this request. Do not output Markdown, private reasoning or native tool calls. Do not invent evidence or alter the contract.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"context\":{\"answer_unit\":\"percent\",\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_context:8e05c3aab553f7fcdc72468c44e4bebea192a8dcb94fad9f99cfef262fbe53ac\",\"indexing\":\"Prelocated relevant numeric evidence with original offsets and necessary source context; no arithmetic plan. Same numeric IDs and values as the complete source.\",\"information_condition\":\"E\",\"necessary_context\":{\"p18\":{\"locator\":[\"pre_text\",18],\"text\":\"rsus are converted to a stock grant only if the company 2019s performance during the fiscal year exceeds pre-established goals the following table summarizes the share-based compensation cost charged to income for ( i ) all stock options granted , ( ii ) our employee stock purchase plan , and ( iii ) our restricted stock program .\"},\"p19\":{\"locator\":[\"pre_text\",19],\"text\":\"the total income tax benefit recognized for share-based compensation in the accompanying statements of income is also presented. .\"}},\"numeric_catalog\":[{\"end\":6,\"id\":\"source:t1c1n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t1c1\",\"start\":2,\"token\":\"18.1\",\"value\":\"181/10\"},{\"end\":6,\"id\":\"source:t1c2n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t1c2\",\"start\":2,\"token\":\"14.6\",\"value\":\"73/5\"},{\"end\":6,\"id\":\"source:t2c1n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t2c1\",\"start\":2,\"token\":\"-6.3\",\"value\":\"-63/10\"},{\"end\":6,\"id\":\"source:t2c2n0\",\"index\":0,\"segment\":\"t2c2\",\"start\":2,\"token\":\"-5.2\",\"value\":\"-26/5\"}],\"question\":\"what is the percentage change in the after-tax share-based compensation cost from 2009 to 2010?\",\"related_source_fragments\":{\"t1c1\":{\"column_label\":\"2010\",\"locator\":[\"table\",1,1],\"row_label\":\"share-based compensation cost\",\"text\":\"$ 18.1\"},\"t1c2\":{\"column_label\":\"2009\",\"locator\":[\"table\",1,2],\"row_label\":\"share-based compensation cost\",\"text\":\"$ 14.6\"},\"t2c1\":{\"column_label\":\"2010\",\"locator\":[\"table\",2,1],\"row_label\":\"income tax benefit\",\"text\":\"$ -6.3 ( 6.3 )\"},\"t2c2\":{\"column_label\":\"2009\",\"locator\":[\"table\",2,2],\"row_label\":\"income tax benefit\",\"text\":\"$ -5.2 ( 5.2 )\"}},\"schema_version\":\"finance_qa_vnext_context.v2\",\"source_digest\":\"f41468ea23720549bd24db3dbb068dfc1de92a6cc906966a0563d1b0f1e3eac7\",\"source_document\":\"GPN/2010/page_87.pdf\",\"task_id\":\"GPN/2010/page_87.pdf-2\"},\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_public_request:8f27609a304920349dcbd1faf771a8f40f6d7cf0e517ef2177dea752f197d564\",\"protocol\":{\"action_admission_uses_reference_plan\":false,\"automatic_execution_or_final_repair\":false,\"claim_type\":\"verified_numeric_derivation_not_financial_role_certification\",\"constants\":[\"constant:1\",\"constant:2\",\"constant:3\",\"constant:4\",\"constant:5\",\"constant:100\",\"constant:1000\",\"constant:1000000\"],\"final_semantics\":\"source-symbolic equivalence and exact source arithmetic, numeric publication and unit/citations\",\"id\":\"finance_qa_vnext_protocol:5d97f034b3a05b3069a0014c5f18b20d0d5b714e4c83d1b8da469a7a8f3e5985\",\"maximum_actions\":12,\"maximum_submissions\":32,\"operations\":{\"absolute\":\"One accepted scalar claim; its absolute value. Never executed implicitly by Final.\",\"add\":\"Two accepted scalar claims/constants, first + second.\",\"average\":\"Two to eight explicitly selected accepted scalar claims/constants; arithmetic mean of selected members.\",\"divide\":\"Two accepted scalar claims/constants, first / second; nonzero denominator.\",\"maximum\":\"Two to eight explicitly selected accepted scalar claims/constants; maximu